WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.480 --> 00:00:07.200
Hi, Mystery Recapped here. Today I am going to&nbsp;
explain a Japanese psychological thriller film&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:07.200 --> 00:00:15.920
called “Tales of the unusual: washing machine.”&nbsp;
Spoilers ahead! Watch out and take care!
&nbsp;

00:00:19.680 --> 00:00:26.720
Hashimoto is a middle-aged man living in Ginza,&nbsp;
Tokyo. He is struggling financially after being&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:26.720 --> 00:00:32.720
laid off from his job. One morning, he goes to the&nbsp;
laundry place to clean his clothes. After loading&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:32.720 --> 00:00:38.640
up the dryer, he wishes he could enjoy a can of&nbsp;
beer. Something drops inside the dryer and makes&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:38.640 --> 00:00:46.000
a loud noise. On checking, he finds a can of beer&nbsp;
inside. At first, Hashimoto believes that someone&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:46.000 --> 00:00:51.280
might have left it there but he is confused&nbsp;
when the beer turns out to be chilled. The old&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:51.280 --> 00:00:57.600
cleaner of the place casually tells him that the&nbsp;
dryer fulfills everyone’s wish. Hashimoto thinks&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:57.600 --> 00:01:04.560
he is a lunatic and ignores him but the man walks&nbsp;
closer and declares he is telling the truth. After&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:04.560 --> 00:01:10.880
he leaves, Hashimoto drinks the beer while waiting&nbsp;
for his clothes to be cleaned. A girl enters the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:10.880 --> 00:01:17.280
room and loads up her laundry. Hashimoto has never&nbsp;
had the courage to talk to women. Because of this,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:17.280 --> 00:01:22.640
he has been single his entire life. He nervously&nbsp;
scoots to the end of the seat to make space&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:22.640 --> 00:01:28.400
for her. The girl sits beside him and starts a&nbsp;
conversation. She has noticed him in the laundry&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:28.400 --> 00:01:34.720
several times before and has developed a crush on&nbsp;
him. Hashimoto, on the other hand, is oblivious&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:34.720 --> 00:01:40.080
of her efforts to start a conversation. 
He throws the now empty can to the trash bin&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:40.080 --> 00:01:46.400
but it lands on the floor. When he gets up to&nbsp;
retrieve it, Kondo starts to cry. An uncomfortable&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:46.400 --> 00:01:52.080
Hashimoto asks her what is wrong when she&nbsp;
reveals that she interviewed for forty companies&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:52.080 --> 00:01:57.440
but didn’t get selected in any. To make her feel&nbsp;
better, he tells her that he was also laid off&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:57.440 --> 00:02:02.720
from his job. He thinks that the fact she was able&nbsp;
to interview for so many companies is amazing.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:02.720 --> 00:02:07.360
This means she has the most experience in&nbsp;
interviews than any of the candidates she&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:07.360 --> 00:02:12.640
meets. The girl starts to look at her situation&nbsp;
differently after the chat. She thanks him for&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:12.640 --> 00:02:18.320
being nice even though she is just a stranger.&nbsp;
Following that, he brings his clothes out and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:18.320 --> 00:02:25.120
wishes her farewell. As he is leaving, the girl&nbsp;
introduces herself as Kondo. After the encounter,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:25.120 --> 00:02:31.520
Hashimoto returns home happily. At night, his&nbsp;
mother calls him, informing him that his father&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:31.520 --> 00:02:37.120
has been hospitalized. They need a total of three&nbsp;
hundred thousand yen to pay for the hospital bill.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:37.120 --> 00:02:44.080
The responsibility falls upon Hashimoto but he&nbsp;
neither has a job, nor savings. Yet, he promises&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:44.080 --> 00:02:49.440
to send them the money and visit them as soon as&nbsp;
possible. He returns to the laundry place the very&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:49.440 --> 00:02:55.040
next morning. He is almost sure that the old man&nbsp;
from yesterday was bluffing, but he still wants to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:55.040 --> 00:03:00.320
test the theory. He stands in front of the dryer&nbsp;
and asks for three hundred thousand yen. 
&nbsp;

00:03:00.960 --> 00:03:06.640
After waiting for a few seconds, he realizes how&nbsp;
stupid the idea is. He is about to leave when&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:06.640 --> 00:03:13.040
suddenly, a bundle of money appears inside the&nbsp;
dryer. Hashimoto brings it out, still unable to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:13.040 --> 00:03:18.320
believe it actually worked. The bundle has&nbsp;
exactly the amount of money he asked for.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:18.320 --> 00:03:23.680
As he tries to walk away with it, he sees the&nbsp;
beer can from yesterday disappearing. The old&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:23.680 --> 00:03:28.880
man informs him that the things he receives&nbsp;
from the dryer will disappear within a day so&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:28.880 --> 00:03:34.880
he should be careful. Hashimoto thanks him and&nbsp;
rushes outside. He happens to bump into Kondo&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:34.880 --> 00:03:40.720
yet again who tells him she got invited for a&nbsp;
second interview for the first time in her life.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:40.720 --> 00:03:47.040
Hashimoto congratulates her and gets a call from&nbsp;
his mother yet again. Kondo hears him talk and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:47.040 --> 00:03:52.400
finds out about his sick father. After chatting&nbsp;
for a while, Hashimoto leaves to quickly send&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:52.400 --> 00:03:56.560
the money before it disappears.
Following that, he returns to the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:56.560 --> 00:04:01.360
laundry place again. He plans to use it&nbsp;
to solve all his problems in life. Hence,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:01.360 --> 00:04:07.120
this time, he asks for a nice suit that he can&nbsp;
wear for job interviews. He goes to interview for&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:07.120 --> 00:04:12.960
several companies the entire day. However, when he&nbsp;
returns home, he gets letters from the companies,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:12.960 --> 00:04:18.960
informing him that he hasn’t been selected in any.&nbsp;
The suit also disappears in front of his eyes.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:22.880 --> 00:04:28.560
After the failure Hashimoto realizes, now that&nbsp;
he has an unlimited source of money, he shouldn’t&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:28.560 --> 00:04:34.560
waste his time looking for a job. Instead, he&nbsp;
should enjoy his life to the fullest. So, the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:34.560 --> 00:04:40.480
next morning, he makes sure no one is around and&nbsp;
wishes for a confident and beautiful girl. He adds&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:40.480 --> 00:04:46.240
that the girl should be envied by everyone, as&nbsp;
beautiful as a model. One such girl steps out of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:46.240 --> 00:04:53.040
the dryer, mesmerizing Hashimoto with her beauty.&nbsp;
He walks closer and asks her to come to his house.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:53.040 --> 00:05:02.880
The girl, however, slaps him in the face for&nbsp;
being so bold on the first date. She storms out&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:02.880 --> 00:05:09.120
of the place as Hashimoto is left stunned. 
After learning from his mistake, he asks for a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:09.120 --> 00:05:14.880
sweet and attentive girlfriend who is pretty and&nbsp;
who loves him very much. A beautiful girl with the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:14.880 --> 00:05:20.880
said qualities steps out of the dryer. The girl&nbsp;
excitedly agrees to go out on a date with him,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:20.880 --> 00:05:26.560
much to his relief. He takes her shopping and uses&nbsp;
the money from the dryer to buy her everything she&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:26.560 --> 00:05:32.960
wants. It turns out that the humans created by&nbsp;
the dryer do not have any idea of their origin&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:32.960 --> 00:05:38.960
and think that they are real people. At the end of&nbsp;
the day, Hashimoto brings her back to his house.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:38.960 --> 00:05:44.480
Even then, he is scared of getting close to&nbsp;
her so they agree to talk the entire night.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:44.480 --> 00:05:51.040
On looking at Hashimoto’s palm the girl comments&nbsp;
that his life is very short. He is taken aback&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:51.040 --> 00:05:56.720
by the comment but decides to ignore it. In the&nbsp;
morning, he finally gathers enough courage to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:56.720 --> 00:06:02.000
lean in to kiss her but she disappears right&nbsp;
before he can. The only things left are the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:02.000 --> 00:06:07.040
clothes and jewelry he bought for her. 
Hashimoto felt a connection with the girl&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:07.040 --> 00:06:12.400
but he is not sad about the disappearance now&nbsp;
that he can get as many girlfriends as he wants.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:12.400 --> 00:06:18.080
Starting that day, he comes to the laundry place&nbsp;
every morning and gets a new girlfriend, each&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:18.080 --> 00:06:23.840
with a different personality. He takes them on&nbsp;
extravagant dates and buys them expensive jewelry&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:23.840 --> 00:06:28.880
with the money from the dryer. He is living his&nbsp;
life to the fullest with his newfound source.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:29.440 --> 00:06:34.720
One day, he is on a date with one of such&nbsp;
girlfriends when Kondo sees him. She gets jealous&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:34.720 --> 00:06:40.480
and curiously follows them to a jewelry store.&nbsp;
On seeing Hashimoto buying the girl an expensive&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:40.480 --> 00:06:46.880
ring, she is furious. She is also confused as to&nbsp;
how he gained so much money in just a few days.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:46.880 --> 00:06:52.400
When Hashimoto goes to the laundry place again&nbsp;
that night, he runs into Kondo. She asks him about&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:52.400 --> 00:06:58.400
the money to which he claims he won a lottery. She&nbsp;
also finds out that he is in a casual relationship&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:58.400 --> 00:07:03.680
with the girl she saw earlier. Kondo starts to&nbsp;
believe that the girl is spoiling him and is&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:03.680 --> 00:07:10.080
using him for his money. Hashimoto is no longer&nbsp;
the man she liked. He dismisses her concerns&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:10.080 --> 00:07:15.520
and walks away with another bundle of money.
Following the encounter, he goes on another date&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:15.520 --> 00:07:21.200
to an expensive restaurant and brings his new&nbsp;
girlfriend to the roof. He also gives her a ring&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:21.200 --> 00:07:27.280
and tells her that he loves her. She disappears&nbsp;
after a few minutes leaving only the ring behind.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:27.280 --> 00:07:31.520
As usual, Hashimoto keeps the ring&nbsp;
with him and continues about his day.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:32.080 --> 00:07:37.840
Since he has been asking for innocent girls till&nbsp;
now, he decides to go for a change and asks for&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:37.840 --> 00:07:45.120
someone who is seductive. One such girl steps out&nbsp;
of the dryer, making him nervous. As they flirt,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:45.120 --> 00:07:50.480
Kondo arrives there and spies on them. She sees&nbsp;
him giving her several rings that he has collected&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:50.480 --> 00:07:55.840
by now. He gets a call from his mother and asks&nbsp;
her to keep quiet for a few seconds. When she&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:55.840 --> 00:08:01.280
doesn't, he has to step out of the room. Kondo&nbsp;
takes the opportunity to talk to the girl and ask&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:01.280 --> 00:08:07.120
her what she has done to the old Hashimoto. When&nbsp;
the girl laughs at her and asks her to go away,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:07.120 --> 00:08:13.600
an enraged Kondo tries to snatch her rings. In the&nbsp;
meantime, Hashimoto talks to his mother who tells&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:13.600 --> 00:08:19.840
him that his father might need an operation. More&nbsp;
than the money, the parents need him to visit them&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:19.840 --> 00:08:24.960
but he has been too busy with his girlfriends&nbsp;
to care. After the call, the old man approaches&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:24.960 --> 00:08:30.960
Hashimoto, saying that he has forgotten to tell&nbsp;
him one important thing about the dryer. 
&nbsp;

00:08:30.960 --> 00:08:35.440
He says that the person who comes out of&nbsp;
the dryer will also disappear in a day.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:35.440 --> 00:08:41.520
Hashimoto laughs at him, claiming he already knew&nbsp;
that. Inside, the girls continue to wrestle to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:41.520 --> 00:08:47.360
get the rings. In the end, the new girl leaves&nbsp;
thinking that Hashimoto was cheating on her.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:47.360 --> 00:08:53.200
He returns to see Kondo crying and hoping that he&nbsp;
would turn into the guy she first met a few days&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:53.200 --> 00:08:59.920
ago. Because of the wish, Hashimoto is teleported&nbsp;
into the dryer. His clothes have changed into what&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:59.920 --> 00:09:06.000
he was wearing when he first met Kondo. He soon&nbsp;
realizes that the dryer has granted Kondo’s wish.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:06.000 --> 00:09:12.080
Since he came out of the dryer, he has only a day&nbsp;
to live. The TV shows the news about thousands of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:12.080 --> 00:09:18.320
yen going missing from a jewelry shop. At the&nbsp;
end of the movie, Hashimoto falls to the ground&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:18.320 --> 00:09:23.360
while Kondo watches him in confusion. 
